#: ../../../../../../../docs/explanation/index.md:9
msgid "理解平台"
msgstr "Understand the platform"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/explanation/index.md:11
msgid "先理解状态、资源和责任，再选择具体接口。图中的依赖、调用、生成和所有权分别标注，架构分层不要求日常 I/O 逐层转发。"
msgstr ""
"Understand state, resources and responsibilities before choosing an "
"interface. Diagrams distinguish dependencies, calls, generation and "
"ownership. Architectural layers do not require ordinary I/O to forward "
"through every layer."
